  "prompt": "Check the workspace, then connect \"Vol Desk Data\" at http://localhost:7801 with one widgets.json entry. Requirements: `vol_screener`: name \"Vol Screener\", description \"Screen names by implied-vol criteria.\", endpoint /vol-screener, type table, sized w=24 h=10 on the grid, category \"Volatility\", params required: ticker \u2014 a ticker picker (type ticker), labeled \"Ticker\", default \"AAPL\"; as_of \u2014 a date picker (type date), labeled \"As of\", default \"$currentDate-1d\"; only_liquid \u2014 a boolean toggle (type boolean), labeled \"Liquid only\", default true; it caches results for 10 minutes. Time-based config converts to milliseconds: \"cache results for N minutes\" means staleTime N*60000; \"auto-refresh every N seconds\" means refetchInterval N*1000.. Build the definition from those words and add the backend.",
  "fixtures": {},
  "initial_state": {},
